# chorus golden vector: hello (the server), protocol v2 message type 0x10.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in hello_server.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "Version 2").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x10, payload length 25 (0x0019), big-endian
10 00 19

# protocol_version = 2
00 02

# roles = 0: the server takes none of the endpoint roles
00 00

# name: length 0 (empty)
00

# software: length 19, then UTF-8 "chorus-server 0.2.0"
13 63 68 6F 72 75 73 2D 73 65 72 76 65 72 20 30
2E 32 2E 30
